  <para style="h">Loma Kunlade Huaisan Xin</para>
  <para style="toc1">Loma Kunlade Huaisan Xin</para>
  <para style="toc2">Loma</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lom</para>
  <para style="mt1">Loma Kunlade Huaisan Xin</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1"/>
  <para style="s">Kielien Asazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1"/>Bishi <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihani hoji <char style="pn">Baolo</char> wo. Hudai gouxioxini zhomen chonjighane giezhi mii uruzhi iredene shitu danlaghawo. <verse eid="ROM 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2"/>Ene gouxioxishi eqighanse Huda xienzhilai tungo giezhi zhiguitu jinwun jiere dain giesan wo. <verse eid="ROM 1:2"/><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3-4"/>Gouxioxishi Hudai kewon, mai Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihai kieliezho. Hhei kunni fanmiende kieliese <char style="pn">Dawude</char>ni houdei wo. Zhiguitu ruhherni fanmiende kieliese fugie nenlighala fugusan kun dundase aminne oluzhi Hudai kewon bikui mejieghawo. <verse eid="ROM 1:3-4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5"/>Huda Mexihai tungo giezhi bijiende shitu danlaku nenjien ogidene soyuji minzulade hhei nierei xianxin gieghazhi shunjighazho. <verse eid="ROM 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6"/>Ene dunda taye wine. Huda tai uruzhi iredene <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihanughun danlaghawo. <verse eid="ROM 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7"/>Huda orezhi uruzhi iredene shentu danlaghasan <char style="png">Loma</char> kunlade bi xin huaizho. Mai ada Huda, Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexiha tande nenjien, pinnan ogi gie!<verse eid="ROM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hudai Gouxioxi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8"/>Bi xien ta dajialade oluzhi <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihai tungo giezhi bi zunjisan Hudade mafan kieliekushi ta xianxin giesei qienxiani kunla man mejiezho. <verse eid="ROM 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9"/>Bi onxian giekude ese beidene tai jilazho. Bi hhei kewonni gouxioxi jiere zhughesene shunjisan Huda enende ganzhen beine. <verse eid="ROM 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10"/>Bi chan xiahua giese Hudai isi enbese bi zuihoude tai hhende echine. <verse eid="ROM 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11"/>Bi tai hende chujiegheku duranshi Hudai nenjienni tande deilazhi tai khiduzheghane giezho. <verse eid="ROM 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12"/>Isishi matan nieniene xianxin giekughala nieniedene zhichi gieye giezho. <verse eid="ROM 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13"/>Gaijiula, psedu minzula dundashiku mutun tai dundase jiego khizheghane giezhi bi tai hhende haojihui echine giesan jihuai tande mejieghaku duran wine. Daliuzhe jiohoro giezhi echi dazho. <verse eid="ROM 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14"/>Bugon <char style="png">Xila</char> kun, wigokun, unhuatu kun, unhua witu kunlade bi yama chaisan mutun giezho. <verse eid="ROM 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15"/>Ingiese bi ta <char style="png">Loma</char>de sousanladeye gouxioxini chonjine giezhi hende duralazho.<verse eid="ROM 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16"/>Bi gouxioxise ulie shizhene. Gouxioxishi soyuji xianxin giesan kunlai jiuiku Hudai nenli wo, xien <char style="png">Yutai</char> kun, pse <char style="png">Xila</char> kun. <verse eid="ROM 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17"/>Gouxioxi jiere Hudai gundanni khizhezho. Ene gundanni kaishi giezhi baratula xianxin giekughala giene. Jinwun jiere kieliesan mutun, "Gou kun xianxin giekughala amiturane."<verse eid="ROM 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jien Kunlani Zui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18"/>Hudai hokuku doghunnighala zhendaoi duisan kunlai soyuji xienlian witu, gou wituni kunlai jiere asiman jierese bouzhezho. <verse eid="ROM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19"/>Ingiekushi kunla Hudai shiqinni mejiekui man mejiene. Hhelade Huda qinchude uzheghawo. <verse eid="ROM 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20"/>Duyai zhayaghasanse Hudai tejien, hhei chanqiku nenlini chanla danema, zhayaghasanlai uzhezhi qinchude mejiene. Ingiese kunlade yama kieliekui uwo. <verse eid="ROM 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21"/>Hhela Hudai mejienema, Huda wo giezhi ulie kuaizhi mafan ulie kieliene. Hhelai sumulaku yama oronde wiku gholuwo, zhugheni benni gholuzhi kharanide wo. <verse eid="ROM 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22"/>Hhela goyane jienzha wo giezhoma, ben wo. <verse eid="ROM 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23"/>Hhela chanqiku Hudai famani fuguku kun, bunzhu, yewo, ghugheilai yanzi gholughawo. <verse eid="ROM 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24"/>Ingiese Huda hhelai ese gonjidene hhela nefuxinne daghazhi zannannide echizhi nieniene beyede shizhekuni giezho. <verse eid="ROM 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25"/>Hhela Hudai zhendaoi jianighala daiqi giedene zhayaghachenni ese beiidene zhayaghasanlai shunjizhi beiine. Hudashi indan chanqi kuaikuni wo. Amine. <verse eid="ROM 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26"/>Ingiese Huda hhelai ese gonjidene hhela shizheku nefuxin giezho. Hhelai biereila zhenchande giekui ulie giedene zhenchan wini giene. <verse eid="ROM 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27"/>Ere kunlaye biereighalane zhenchande giekuni ulie giedene nienieni nefuxin bazilie dase ere kun ere kunghala shizhekuni giene. Ingiezhi hhelai codasande indan chenfa giekui goya jierene ireghazho.<verse eid="ROM 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28"/>Hhela Hudai tanise guazi wo giese Huda hhelai ese gonjidene guazitu sumuladande fanqi giewo. Ingiese hhela ulie giekuni giezho. <verse eid="ROM 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29"/>Hhelade yanyanji gou wini, doghunni, tanxin, mouxienni duruzho. Dubilieku, alaku, eghinduku, piendaku, tuguni duruzho. Xienhua kieliene, <verse eid="ROM 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30"/>beihoude kunni sugiene, Hudai henjine, kunni yamacha ulie teine, goyane fugiede uzhezhi kuaine, doghun shiqinyi khizheghane, ada anadene ulie shunjine. <verse eid="ROM 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31"/>Yama ulie mejiene, kieliendene ulie kurune, oreku, ubali xiiku zhughe uwo. <verse eid="ROM 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32"/>Hudai guijin mutunshi jien ene shiqinni giesan kun indan fugukuni hhela mejiene. Ingieliuzhe goyalane giene, da kunla giese gou wo giezho.<verse eid="ROM 1:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2"/>
  <para style="s">Huda Zui Jinjizho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1"/>Ingiese chi ene kunlai kieliechen kun, chi kienliuzhe yama jiekou erei dane. Chi kunlai kieliekude goyaneye niekielienji giese goyadene zui jinjizho. <verse eid="ROM 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2"/>Huda intui giechen kunlai gundande panjikui matan mejiene. <verse eid="ROM 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3"/>Chi ene kunlai kieliedene niekielienji giesan kun, chi sumulase Hudai panjikuse andane giezhou? <verse eid="ROM 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4"/>Huda tebieji goude giezhi, ranjizhi, rennai giese chi meilade uzhenu? Huda chade goude giekushi chii geizhen gieghane giekuni ulie mejienu? <verse eid="ROM 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5"/>Chii zhughe khidunde geizhen ulie giedene Huda gundande panjiku hhe udu kuzhetula goyadene Hudai hokukui izhi olodoghazho. <verse eid="ROM 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6"/>Huda kunla giekughala kunlade kharulune. <verse eid="ROM 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7"/>Gou wilieni izhi giezhi kuaiku, gou minshen, chanqi ulie qida olukuni giesan kunlade Huda chanqiku aminni ogine. <verse eid="ROM 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8"/>Zi goyane guizhi zhendaoni ulie shunjidene gou winii shunjichen kunlade hokuku, faikughala kharulune. <verse eid="ROM 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9"/>Jien doghunnii giesan kunlade zeinan, tunkuni ogine. Xien <char style="png">Yutai</char> kun, pse <char style="png">Xila</char> kun. <verse eid="ROM 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10"/>Jien gounii giesan kunlade kuaiku, gou minshen, pinnanni ogine. Xien <char style="png">Yutai</char> kun, pse <char style="png">Xila</char> kun. <verse eid="ROM 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11"/>Huda kunlai pienxin ulie giene.<verse eid="ROM 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12"/>Jien guijinni chenliezhi uye daodene zui fanjisan kunla guijinghala gonxi widene widane. Jien guijinni chenliedene zui fanjisan kunlai guijinghala panjine. <verse eid="ROM 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13"/>Guijinni chenliese Hudai melie gounide ulie sanane, guijinni zunjise gounide sanane. <verse eid="ROM 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14"/>Guijin ese ogisan niman kunla olusanse goyane guijin mutun giese, hhelade guijin uwoma, ene hhelai guijin gholuwo. <verse eid="ROM 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15"/>Giesanlaini uzhese guijinni yoqiu hhelai zhughede teisei mejiene. Lianxinniye enende ganzhen beine. Hhelai zhughede maodun giezhi goyane kheilane, baohu giene. <verse eid="ROM 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16"/>Eneshi, bi chonjisan gouxioxi mutun, Huda Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i tungo giezhi kunla niuighasan shiqin man panjiku hhe udude fashen giene.<verse eid="ROM 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yutai Kunni Guijin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17"/>Chi ene goyane <char style="png">Yutai</char> kun wo giesan, guijinni kouizhi Hudai mejiene giezhi goyane kuaizho. <verse eid="ROM 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18"/>Chi Hudai isii mejiene, guijinse suruzhi gounii fenji shidane, <verse eid="ROM 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19"/>goyane sughoni udurusan wo, kharani dundadu gon wo giezho. <verse eid="ROM 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20"/>Chi guijinghala erlin, zhendaoi zhanwo giezhi ben kun, kesilade sughachen loushi danlane giezhi goyane xianxin giezho. <verse eid="ROM 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21"/>Qinse chi kunlade sughase goyadene yan giezhi ese sughazho? Kunlade bu ghula giezhi sughadene goyane ghulanu? <verse eid="ROM 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22"/>Chi kunlade piofen bu gie giezhi kieliedene goyane piofen gienu? Chi nigiedalai uzhe dadene, goyane mioni dunxii ghulanu? <verse eid="ROM 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23"/>Chi guijinni kuaidene guijinni fanjizhi Hudai shizheghanu? <verse eid="ROM 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24"/>Jinwun jiere kieliesan mutun, "Tai yenyinghala niman kunlai dunda Hudai nierei sugiezho." <verse eid="ROM 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25"/>Chi guijinni zunjise giesan hetoune haochu wine. Hetoune giedene guijinni fanjise hetoune ese giesanghala niekielien wo. <verse eid="ROM 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26"/>Ingiese hetoune ese giesanla guijinni zunjise hetoune ese giezhoma hetoude ulie sananu? <verse eid="ROM 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27"/>Hetoune ese giedene guijinni zunjisan kunla hetoune giezhi huaisan guijinni bidene guijinni fanjisan kunni zui jinjine. <verse eid="ROM 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28"/>Biomien jiere <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunshi <char style="png">Yutai</char> kun pusho. Beye, mienzide giesan hetouneshi zhen hetoune pusho. <verse eid="ROM 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29"/>Zinie sudoro <char style="png">Yutai</char> kun danlasan kunshi <char style="png">Yutai</char> kun wo. Zhen hetouneshi zhughenughun wo. Huaisande ulie kouine. Shenlinde kouine. Ene kunyi kuaikushi kunse iresan pusho, Hudase wo.<verse eid="ROM 2:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1"/>Ingiese <char style="png">Yutai</char> kun danlase yan haochu wo? Hetoune giese yande gou wo? <verse eid="ROM 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2"/>Go fanmiende wine. Xien Hudai kielienyi hhelade ogiwo. <verse eid="ROM 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3"/>Niezhanla xianxin ulie giese matugiene? Hhela kekao wise Hudaye kekao uwonu? <verse eid="ROM 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4"/>Kenjin pusho! Kunla man ghudan kieliese Huda ghudan ulie kieliene. Jinwun jiere jilasan mutun,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">"Chi kielien kieliekude gundan wo giene.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:4">Shenwun giekude chi injine."<verse eid="ROM 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5"/>Matanyi gou wiku Hudai gounii khizheghase matan matui kieliene? Huda matanyi faise gundan uwonu? Bi kunni jiodughala kieliezho. <verse eid="ROM 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6"/>Kenjin pusho! Qinse Huda matugie duyani panjine? <verse eid="ROM 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7"/>Bi ghudan kieliedene Hudai zhennii qinchushighazhi hhei kuaise mii yangiezhi zuiren mutun panjine? <verse eid="ROM 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8"/>Qinse matan huaini gieyema, gouni irene giezhi yale ulie kieliene? Niezhanla bijien ingiezhi kieliezho giezhi zhazho. Ene kunlai indan panjikuni wo.<verse eid="ROM 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gou Kun Nieda Uwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9"/>Ingiese bijien <char style="png">Yutai</char> kun niman kunlase hen onu? Kenjin pusho! Kunla man zui dunda wo, <char style="png">Yutai</char> kun niman kun man niekielien wo giezhi bijien kieliezhi daozho. <verse eid="ROM 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10"/>Jinwun jiere jilasan mutun,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:10">"Gou kun uwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:10">nieliuzhe uwo.<verse eid="ROM 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11"/>Minbai oluchen kun uwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:11">Hudai ereichen kun uwo.<verse eid="ROM 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12"/>Kunla man xiemachalazhi yama oronde uwo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">Gounii giechen kun uwo, nieliuzhe uwo."<verse eid="ROM 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13"/>"Hhelai gholei keisan meza niekielien wo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">Hhelai kielienshi kun piendakui wo."</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:13">"Hhelai aman furedeni mogheii du wine."<verse eid="ROM 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14"/>"Hhelai amande okho sugiekui duruzho."<verse eid="ROM 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15"/>"Kun alane giese ghujin no wo.<verse eid="ROM 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16"/>Kurusan orondeni pohai nangoi jiezho.<verse eid="ROM 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17"/>Pinnanni moni ulie mejiene."<verse eid="ROM 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18"/>"Hudase goujida ulie ayine."<verse eid="ROM 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19"/>Guijinshi guijintu kunlade kieliesei matan mejiene. Ingiedene soyuji kunlai amanni menjighazhi qienxiani kunlai man Hudai panjikude ireghane. <verse eid="ROM 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20"/>Guijinni zunjizhi giedene Hudai melie gounide sanasan kun nieda uwo. Guijinni tungo giezhi zuini mejiene.<verse eid="ROM 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Xianxin Giekughala Gounide Sanane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21"/>Ede guijinse chugo Hudai gundanni khizhezho. Enende guijinshu, xienzhishu jiere ganzhen beizho. <verse eid="ROM 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22"/>Hheshijiu <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihai xianxin giesan jien kunlade olusan Hudai gundanni wo. Yan kunliuzhe niekielien wo. <verse eid="ROM 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23"/>Jien kunla zui fanjidene Hudai famade dai dazhoma, <verse eid="ROM 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24"/><char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihai shuikui tungo giezhi Hudai nenjienghala belien gouni wo giezho. <verse eid="ROM 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25"/>Huda <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i kunni oronde fugughazhi shuiku gholughawo. Hhei xianxin giesan kunlai zuini mienliene. Ingiezhi Huda gundanne uzheghawo. Eqighandei Huda kunla fanjisan zuini rennai giezhi ese gonjizho. <verse eid="ROM 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26"/>Edeku shihoude ingiezhi Huda goyaneshi gundan bikui, pse <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i xianxin giesan kunlai gounii uzheghazho.<verse eid="ROM 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27"/>Ingiese matan yanni kuaine? Yama kuaikui uwo. Yan banfaghala wo? Gieku banfaghala onu? Pusho! Xianxin gieku banfaghala wo. <verse eid="ROM 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28"/>Bijien uzhese kunni gounide sanakushi guijinni zunjizhi giekughala pusho, xianxin giekughala wo. <verse eid="ROM 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29"/>Hudashi zinie <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunlai Huda onu? Niman kunlai Huda pushonu? Enbene, hheshi niman kunlai Hudaye enbene. <verse eid="ROM 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30"/>Hudashi nie wo. Hetoune giesanlai xianxin giekughala gounide sanane, hetoune uye giesanlaiye xianxin giekughala gounide sanane. <verse eid="ROM 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31"/>Ingiese matan xianxin giekughala guijinni bendazhou? Kenjin uye! Khareidene guijinni khiduzheghazho.<verse eid="ROM 3:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4"/>
  <para style="s">Iburaheimuni Xianxin Gieku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1"/>Ingiese bijienyi minzui xienren <char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char>i matui kieliene? Hhe yan mejiewo? <verse eid="ROM 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2"/><char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char> giekughala gounide sanazhoshi kuai shidanema, Hudai melie kuaikui uwo. <verse eid="ROM 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3"/>Jinwun jiere matui kieliezho? <char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char> Hudai xianxin giedene Huda hhei gounide sanazho giezho. <verse eid="ROM 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4"/>Wilie giezhi gunzi bareise indanji wo, nenjiende ulie sanane. <verse eid="ROM 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5"/>Kun yama wilie ulie giedene xienlian witu kunlai gouni wo giesan Hudai xianxin giese hhei xianxin giekuni gounide sanane. <verse eid="ROM 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6"/>Wilie giekughala gonxi wi Huda gounide sanasan kunlade fuqi winekui <char style="pn">Dawude</char>ye kieliezho,<verse eid="ROM 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7"/>"Codasanyi rouliezhi zuini khasan kunlade fuqi wine.<verse eid="ROM 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8"/>Huda zui uwo giesan kunlade fuqi wine."<verse eid="ROM 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9"/>Ingiese ene fuqii zinie hetoune giesan kunlade ogizhou? Hetoune ese giesan kunlade uye ogizhou? <char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char> xianxin giekughala gounide sanasanyi matan kieliezho. <verse eid="ROM 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10"/>Hhei yan xienzide gounide sanazho? Hetoune gietula onu, hetoune giedene wo? Hetoune giedene pusho, gietula wo. <verse eid="ROM 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11"/>Hhe giesan hetouneshi hetoune ese giekude xianxin giekughala gouni wo giesande zhanzi taisan hao wo. Ingiedene hhezighan hetoune ese gie xianxin giekughala gounide sanasan kunlade xienren danlawo. <verse eid="ROM 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12"/><char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char>shi hetoune giesan kunlai xienrenye enbene. Zinie hetoune gieku pusho. Mai xienren <char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char> hetoune ese giekude xianxin giesan yanziini daghasan kunlai xienren wo.<verse eid="ROM 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Huda Dain Giesei Xianxin Giekughala Chenjiwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13"/>Huda <char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char>ji houdeiladeni duyani ogine giezhi dain giesanshi guijinghala pusho, xianxin giedene iresan gounighala wo. <verse eid="ROM 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14"/>Zinie guijintu kunlade ogizhoshi xianxin giesan yama oronde uwo, dain giesanyiye ulie sanane. <verse eid="ROM 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15"/>Guijin Hudai hokukuni ireghazho. Guijin wise guijinyi fanjiku shiqinye uwo.<verse eid="ROM 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16"/>Ingiese dain giesanshi xianxin giekughala ogizho. Hheshi <char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char>ni houdeilade belien ogisan nenjien wo. Zinie guijintu kunlade ogisan pusho, <char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char> mutun xianxin giesan kunladeye bouisan wo. Hudai melie <char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char>shi matan dajialai xienren wo. <verse eid="ROM 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17"/>Jinwun jiere jilasan mutun, "Bi chii olon minzulai xienren gholughane." Fugusan kunni aminne olughachen, uwokuse wineku gholughachen Hudai <char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char> xianxin giewo. <verse eid="ROM 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18"/>Hhe xiwon wikude xiwon giezhi olon minzulai xienren danlakui xianxin giewo. Huda hhende kieliesan mutun, "Chii houdeila ingiezhi olodone." <verse eid="ROM 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19"/>Hhe 100 oluzhi beyeni fuguku mutun, biereini olu dakui mejieliuzhe xianxin giekuni ese zholierezho. <verse eid="ROM 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20"/>Huda dain giesanyi xianxin giezhi uye inxin giedene kharei xianxin giekuni khiduzhezhi Hudai kuaizho. <verse eid="ROM 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21"/>Huda dain giesei chenjighakui hhe hende xianxin giezho. <verse eid="ROM 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22"/>Ingiese hhei gounide sanazho. <verse eid="ROM 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23"/>Gounide sanazho giesan ene kielienyi zinie hhende ese huaizho, <verse eid="ROM 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24"/>matandeye huaizho. Mai Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i fugusan kun dundase aminne olughasan Hudai xianxin giesan maiye gounide sanane. <verse eid="ROM 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25"/><char style="pn">Ersa</char>i kunlade jiuizhi mai zuide oluzhi duya ijiewo, matanyi gounide sanane giezhi aminne oluwo.<verse eid="ROM 4:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5"/>
  <para style="s">Matan Hudare Goudazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1"/>Ingiese matan xianxin giekughala gounide sanase matan mai Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihai tungo giezhi Hudare goudazho. <verse eid="ROM 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2"/>Matan <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i tungo giezhi xianxin giekughala ede xianshou giesan nenjiende irezho. Da bayasuzhi Hudai famani panjizho. <verse eid="ROM 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3"/>Zinie ene pusho. Chijia dundaye bayasune. Chijiase rennai surune, <verse eid="ROM 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4"/>rennaise undan surune, undanse xiwon surukuni matan mejiene. <verse eid="ROM 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5"/>Xiwon matai ulie kushidaghakushi Huda matande ogisan Shenlinni tungo giezhi orekune matai zhughede kie durughawo.<verse eid="ROM 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6"/>Matande banfa widakude shihou kuruse Mexiha matan xienlian witu kunlade oluzhi duya ijiewo. <verse eid="ROM 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7"/>Gundan kunde oluzhi fuguchen kun choghon wo, gou kunde oluzhi fuguchen kun kenen winema, <verse eid="ROM 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8"/>matan dou zuiren bikude Mexiha matande oluzhi fugudene Huda matande oresanne qinchude uzheghazho. <verse eid="ROM 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9"/>Ede Mexihai chusunyi tungo giezhi matai gounide sanawo, hhe Hudai hokusanse matai genjia jiuine. <verse eid="ROM 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10"/>Matan Hudai duitou bikude hhe kewonne fugughazhi matanre goudazho, Mexihai aminghala matai genjia jiuine. <verse eid="ROM 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11"/>Zinie ene pusho. Matan Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihai tungo giezhi Hudare goudadene Hudai yenyin jiere bayasuzho.<verse eid="ROM 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Adan Mexihaghala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12"/>Ingiese zui nie kunse duyade irezhi fuguku zuise iresan mutun kunla man zui fanjidene fuguku kunlai jiere irezho. <verse eid="ROM 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13"/>Guijin witula zui duyade winema, guijin uwoshi zuide ulie sanane. <verse eid="ROM 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14"/>Ingieliuzhe <char style="pn">Adan</char>se <char style="pn">Musa</char>de kurutula fuguku qienli bareizho. Lien <char style="pn">Adan</char> fanjisan zuini ese fanjisan kunlaye man fuguzho. <char style="pn">Adan</char>shi khuina ireku hhe kunyi yanzi wo.<verse eid="ROM 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15"/>Ingiese nenjien zuighala buxian wo. Nie kun zui fanjise olon kunla fuguzhoma, Hudai nenjien, <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexiha niezheghanyi nenjienghala belien ogisan mure olon kunlade genjia olon ogizho. <verse eid="ROM 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16"/>Huda ogisan mure nie kun fanjisan zuighala buxian wo. Panjikushi nie kun zui fanjisande zui jinjizho, nenjienshi olon kunla zui fanjisande gounide sanasan wo giezho. <verse eid="ROM 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17"/>Nie kun zui fanjise fuguku nie kunni tungo giezhi qienli bareizho, nenjien olon jienliezhi belien gouni wo giesan hhezighan kunla <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexiha niezheghanyi tungo giezhi amin dunda qienli genjia bareine.<verse eid="ROM 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18"/>Ingiese nie zui fanjidene soyuji kunlade zui jinjiku mutun, nie gounii giedene soyuji kunlai gounide sanazhi amin ogiwo. <verse eid="ROM 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19"/>Nie kun ulie shunjidene olon kunlai zuiren gholughaku mutun, nie kun shunjidene olon kunlai gounide sananne. <verse eid="ROM 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20"/>Guijin iredene zui olodozhoma, zui olodosan oronde nenjien genjia fugiedazho. <verse eid="ROM 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21"/>Ingiedene zui qienli bareizhi fugukui ogisan mutun, nenjien qienli bareizhi kunlai gounide sanadene mai Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihani tungo giezhi chanqiku amin ogizho.<verse eid="ROM 5:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6"/>
  <para style="s">Mexihai Kouizhi Udu Dao</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1"/>Ingiese matan matui kieliene? Matan nenjienni olodoghane giezhi zui dunda izhi beinu? <verse eid="ROM 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2"/>Kenjin ulie olune! Matan zui miende fugudene matugie zui dunda udu daone? <verse eid="ROM 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3"/>Matan xilii jienliezhi Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>re hhantulasan kun hhere hhantu fugusei ta ulie mejienu? <verse eid="ROM 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4"/>Matan xilii tungo giezhi hhere hhantu fuguzhi hhantu bulawo. Ingiekushi Adai famaghala Mexihai fugusan kun dundase aminne olughasan mutun mataiye shini amin dunda udu daoghane giezho. <verse eid="ROM 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5"/>Matan hhe fugukude hhere hhantulase hhe aminne olukudeye hhere hhantulane. <verse eid="ROM 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6"/>Matan khuichen kunne hhere hhantu shizijia jiere ghadazhi zuitu beyene widaghasei mejiene. Ingiese matan pse zuide hoji ulie danlane. <verse eid="ROM 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7"/>Fugusan kun zuise andazho. <verse eid="ROM 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8"/>Matan Mexihare hhantu fuguse hhereye hhantu amiturakui xianxin giene. <verse eid="ROM 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9"/>Mexiha fugusan kun dundase aminne oluzhi pse ulie fugune. Fuguku hhei kunzhi gie dakui matan mejiene. <verse eid="ROM 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10"/>Hhe fuguse zui miende 1 huide fuguwo. Amiturase Hudai miende amiturazho. <verse eid="ROM 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11"/>Taye zui miende goyane fugusan sanazhi Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i tungo giezhi Hudai miende amitu sana.<verse eid="ROM 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12"/>Ingiese zuini tai fuguku beye jiere qienli bu bareighazhi zui gieku nefuxinyi bu dagha. <verse eid="ROM 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13"/>Ta beye jieredu yama iyanzii zuide ogizhi gou winide jiaji bu danlagha. Khareidene fugusan kun dundase aminne olusan kun wo giezhi goyane Hudade ogi. Beye jieredulane man Hudade ogizhi gou jiaji danlagha. <verse eid="ROM 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14"/>Zui tai gonji dakushi ta guijin doura uwo, nenjien doura wo.<verse eid="ROM 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gounide Hoji Danla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15"/>Qinse matugiene? Matan guijin doura uwo, nenjien dourashi zui fanjise olunu? Kenjin ulie olune! <verse eid="ROM 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16"/>Ta goyane kiende ogizhi kienyi shunjise kiende hoji danlakui ta ulie mejienu? Zuini hoji danlase fugune, Hudai shunjichen hoji danlase gouni gholune. <verse eid="ROM 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17"/>Hudade mafan kielieye, ta melieshida zuini hoji woma, ede tande chonjisan daolini ta zhughesene shunjiwo. <verse eid="ROM 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18"/>Ingiedene zuise tai andaghazhi gounide hoji danlawo. <verse eid="ROM 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19"/>Ta dunjire dakuse ayizhi bi ibanji kielienghala kielieye. Ta melieshida beyene ganjin winide, uhunnide ogizhi hoji danladene uhunni gholughasan mutun ede ta beyene gounide ogizhi hoji danladene zhiguitu gholugha. <verse eid="ROM 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20"/>Ta zuide hoji danlakude gouni gieku biyo uwo. <verse eid="ROM 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21"/>Ingiese ta ede sumulase shizheku shiqinyi hhe xienzide giedene tande yan haochu wo? Hhei jiegoshi fuguku wo. <verse eid="ROM 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22"/>Ede tai zuise andaghazhi Hudai hoji danlaghawo. Tai haochushi zhigui wo. Jiegoshi chanqiku amin wo. <verse eid="ROM 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23"/>Zuini daijiashi fugukuni wo. Hudai nenjienshi mai Ezhan Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i sudoro bisan chanqiku amin wo.<verse eid="ROM 6:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7"/>
  <para style="s">Hunyenni Bilazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1"/>Gaijiula, ta guijinni mejiechen kunlade bi kielieye. Guijinshi kun zinie amitu bikude oronde bisei ta ulie mejienu? <verse eid="ROM 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2"/>Biereide zhanguiji bizhi amitushi guijinni yenyinghala zhanguijisene likai gie dane. Zhanguijini fuguse zhanguijine guijinse andawo. <verse eid="ROM 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3"/>Ingiese zhanguijini bidene pse nie kunde khise biozi giezhi urune. Zhanguijini fuguse hhe guijinse andawo. Pse nie kunde khise biozi pusho.<verse eid="ROM 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4"/>Mii gaijiula, taye niekielien wo. Ta Mexihani beyei tungo giezhi guijinse fuguwo. Ingiedene pse nienughun gholuzhi matan Hudade gou jiego ireghane. Hheshi fugusan kun dundase aminne olusan Mexiha wo. <verse eid="ROM 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5"/>Matan beyenughun bikude zui gieku nefuxin guijinni tungo giezhi mai jiere wilie giedene fugukui ireghawo. <verse eid="ROM 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6"/>Ede matanyi banlasan guijinse matan fuguzhi andawo. Ingiese matan Ezhanni shunjise uroughala giesan guijinni khuichen banfaghala ulie giene, Shenlinni shini banfaghala giene.<verse eid="ROM 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Guijin Zuighala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7"/>Ingiese matan matui kieliene? Guijinshi zui onu? Kenjin pusho! Guijin uwoshi bi yanshi zui bikui ulie mejiene. Guijin jiere tanxin bu gie giezhi ese kieliezhoshi bi tanxinshi yan bikui ulie mejiene. <verse eid="ROM 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8"/>Zui minlinghala jihui ereizhi mii zhughede yanyanji tanxin giekui khizheghazho. Guijin uwoshi zuishi fugusei wo. <verse eid="ROM 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9"/>Eqighan guijin uwokude bi amitu wo. Minlin irese zui aminne oluwo, bi fuguwo. <verse eid="ROM 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10"/>Hhe yenlai amin ireghaku minlin mii fugukui gholughawo. <verse eid="ROM 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11"/>Zui minlinni jihuighala mii piendadene hhei tungo giezhi mii fugughawo. <verse eid="ROM 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12"/>Ingiese guijinshi zhiguitu wo. Minlinshiye zhiguitu, gundan, gouni wo. <verse eid="ROM 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13"/>Qinse gouni khareidene mii fugughanu? Kenjin pusho! Mii fugughasanshi zui wo. Zuishi zui bikui mejieghane giezhi gounii tungo giezhi mii fugughawo. Minlinyi tungo giezhi zui zhenzhen doghunne khizheghazho.<verse eid="ROM 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ruhher Beyeni Duranghala Eghinduzho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14"/>Guijinshi ruhhernughun bikui matan mejienema, bishi beyenughun wo. Mii zuide huizhi hoji danlaghawo. <verse eid="ROM 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15"/>Bi giene giekune ulie giene, henjisanne kharei giene. Bi yan giesanne ulie mejiene. <verse eid="ROM 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16"/>Bi henjisanne giese guijinshi gouni bikui bi chenren giezho. <verse eid="ROM 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17"/>Ingiese giesanshi bi pusho, mii sudoro sousan zui giezho. <verse eid="ROM 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18"/>Mii sudoro, mii beye jiere gouni uwokui bi mejiene. Bi gounii gieku duran winema, gie dane. <verse eid="ROM 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19"/>Bi gounii gieku duran winema, ulie giene. Doghunnii gieku duran uwoma, khareidene giene. <verse eid="ROM 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20"/>Bi duran wikune giese giesanshi bi pusho. Mii sudoro sousan zui giezho. <verse eid="ROM 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21"/>Bi nie guijin mejiewo. Bi gounii giene giekude doghunniye hhantu wo. <verse eid="ROM 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22"/>Bi sudorone kun Hudai guijinde xiqi woma, <verse eid="ROM 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23"/>beye jieremi pse nie guijin mii zhugheni guijinghala maodun giezhi mii bareidene beye jiere bisan zuini guijinde hoji danlaghasei bi chanlazho. <verse eid="ROM 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24"/>Mii amin muchughun wo, kien mii ene fuguku beyese jiuizhi khizheghane? <verse eid="ROM 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25"/>Mai Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihai tungo giezhi Hudade mafan kielieye! Ingiese mii sumulaku Hudai guijinni shunjizho, mii beye zuini guijinni shunjizho.<verse eid="ROM 7:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8"/>
  <para style="s">Shenlinni Daghazhi Gie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1"/>Ingiese ede Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i miendedu kunlade zui jiedui ulie jinjine. <verse eid="ROM 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2"/>Amin ogiku Shenlinni guijin Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i tungo giezhi zuiji fuguku guijinse chii andaghawo. <verse eid="ROM 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3"/>Kunde lilian wiku yenyinghala guijin gie dakui Huda giewo. Huda zuini widaghane giezhi Kewonne zuitu beyeni yanzighala peizhi ireghadene zuini kunlai ese gonjighawo. <verse eid="ROM 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4"/>Ingiedene beyeni ulie daghazhi Shenlinni daghasan mai jiere guijinyi yoqiui gholughawo. <verse eid="ROM 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5"/>Beyeni daghasan kunla beyeni shiqinyi gonxin giene. Shenlinni daghasan kunla Shenlinni shiqinyi gonxin giene. <verse eid="ROM 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6"/>Beyeni shiqinyi gonxin giese fugune. Shenlinni shiqinyi gonxin giese amin, pinnan irene. <verse eid="ROM 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7"/>Kun beyeni shiqinyi gonxin giese Hudaghala duitou gholune. Hudai guijinni ulie shunjine, shunjiye dane. <verse eid="ROM 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8"/>Beyenughunla Hudai bayasugha dane.<verse eid="ROM 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9"/>Hudai Ruhher tai sudoro souse tashi beyenughun pusho, Shenlinnughun wo. Kunde Mexihani ruhher uwoshi Mexihanughun pusho. <verse eid="ROM 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10"/>Mexiha tai sudoro bise beye zuini yenyinghala fuguzhoma, ruhher gounii yenyinghala amiturazho. <verse eid="ROM 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11"/><char style="pn">Ersa</char>i fugusan kun dundase aminne olughasan Hudai Ruhher tai sudoro souse Mexihai fugusan kun dundase aminne olughasan Huda tai sudoro sousan Shenlinne tungo giezhi tai fuguku beyeni aminne olughane.<verse eid="ROM 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12"/>Gaijiula, ingiese matan beyede zhan chaisan mutun hhei daghazhi gieku biyo uwo. <verse eid="ROM 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13"/>Ta beyeni daghazhi giese fugune. Shenlinde kouizhi beyeni doghun wiliei fugughase amiturane. <verse eid="ROM 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14"/>Jien Hudai Ruhher udurusanlashi Hudai kewosi wo. <verse eid="ROM 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15"/>Ta jienliesanshi hojini ruhher pusho. Pse ulie ayighane. Jienliesanshi kewosi danlaku ruhher wo. Ingiese matan Aba, ada giezhi urune. <verse eid="ROM 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16"/>Shenlin qinsi matanyi ruhherre hhantu matanshi Hudai kewosi wo giezhi ganzhen beizho. <verse eid="ROM 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17"/>Kewosi enbese jiachanyi jienliechen enbene. Matanshi Mexihare hhantu jiachanyi jienliechen Hudai kewosi wo. Matan hhere shouku giekude hhantulase famadeye hhantulane.<verse eid="ROM 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jianlaiku Fama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18"/>Bi uzhese edeku shouku gieku jianlai matande ireku famaghala bilazhi ulie olune. <verse eid="ROM 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19"/>Zhayaghasanla jirezhi Hudai kesila xienjizhi khizhekuni panjizho. <verse eid="ROM 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20"/>Zhayaghasanla yama oronde widawo. Hhela imutui gholukushi goya duranghalane pusho, Huda ingiezhi gieghawo. <verse eid="ROM 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21"/>Hhela qida olusande hoji danlakuse andadene Hudai kesilani famatu ziyuni jienliekui panjizho. <verse eid="ROM 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22"/>Zhayaghasanla man hhantu shonholozhi tendun shouizhi eli kusanyi matan mejiene. <verse eid="ROM 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23"/>Zinie zhayaghasanla pusho, Shenlinshi toushu alima wo giezhi jienliesan matanye zhughedene shonholozhi Hudai kewosi danlaku, pse mai beyei jiuizhi shuikui panjizho. <verse eid="ROM 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24"/>Onxianghala matanyi jiuiwo. Chujieghekui onxian giese onxian pusho. Chujieghekui kien onxian giene? <verse eid="ROM 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25"/>Matan chujieghe dakune onxian giese rennai giezhi panjikuni wo.<verse eid="ROM 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26"/>Niekielien wo, Shenlinye matan zholierekude banman giene. Matan indan matugie onxian giekui ulie mejienema, Shenlin hende nango giezhi qinsi matande xiahua giene. <verse eid="ROM 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27"/>Kunni zhughei uzhechen Huda Shenlinyi sumulakui mejiene. Shenlin zhao Hudai isighala shentulade oluzhi xiahua giezho. <verse eid="ROM 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28"/>Hudade oresan kun, jiushi Huda jihuaghalane uruzhi iresan kunlade shiqinla man hhantulazhi gouni gholukui matan mejiene. <verse eid="ROM 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29"/>Huda eqie mejiesan kunlai kewonne yanzi mutun gholughane giezhi pse eqie jinjiwo. Ingiezhi kewonne olon gaijiu dunda fugie kewon danlaghane giezho. <verse eid="ROM 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30"/>Hhe eqighan jinjisan kunlai pse uruzhi irewo. Uruzhi iresan kunlai pse gounide sanawo. Gounide sanasan kunlai famani gholughawo.<verse eid="ROM 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hudai Oreku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31"/>Ingiese matan enezighan shiqinde yan kieliene? Huda matande banman giese kien fandui giene? <verse eid="ROM 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32"/>Huda Kewonne sheizhi matande ogiwoma, hhere hhantu pseshikulai man matande ulie oginu? <verse eid="ROM 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33"/>Kien Huda sunghusan kunlai zha shidane? Hhelai gounide sanasanshi Huda wo. <verse eid="ROM 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34"/>Kien hhelade zui jinjine? Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char> duya ijiezhi aminne oludene ede Hudai borun miende bizhi matande oluzhi xiahua giezho. <verse eid="ROM 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35"/>Kien Mexiha matande orekui siraghane? Kunnan onu? Khishun onu? Heiku onu? Oliesuku onu? Nanxin onu? Wixien onu? Khudogho onu? <verse eid="ROM 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36"/>Jinwun jiere jilasan mutun,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">"Chii yenyinghala bijienyi chanqi alazho.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 8:36">Kunla bijienyi alaku ghoni mutun uzhezho."<verse eid="ROM 8:36"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37"/>Ingieliuzhe matande oresan Ezhanni tungo giezhi ene soyuji shiqin jiere suibiende injine. <verse eid="ROM 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38"/>Bi hende xianxin giese bugon fuguku, amituku, qienxien, qienli bareichen, edeku shiqin, jianlaiku shiqin, lilian, <verse eid="ROM 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39"/>unduni, gunni, psedu zhayaghasanla man Huda mai ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihai tungo giezhi matande orekui siragha dane.<verse eid="ROM 8:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9"/>
  <para style="s">Huda Isilie Kunlai Sunghuwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1"/>Bi Mexihani miende shuhuai kieliene, ghudan ulie kieliene. Mii lianxin Shenlinyi tungo giezhi made ganzhen beizho. <verse eid="ROM 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2"/>Bi hende munan giezhi zhughedemi izhi otuzho. <verse eid="ROM 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3"/>Bi gaijiuladene oluzhi mii kharazhi Mexihare danlinraghaseye duran wine. Hhelashi mare nie minzu wo, <verse eid="ROM 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4"/>yeshi <char style="png">Isilie</char> kun wo. Kewonni nexian, fama, yenjisan kielien, guijin, libai gieku banfa, dain giesei man hhelade ogizho. <verse eid="ROM 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5"/>Hhe famatu xienrenlashi hhelanughun wo. Mexihaye kunni fanmiende kieliese hhelase khizhezho. Mexihashi manlai gonjisan Huda wo, chanqi doulakui wo. Amine!<verse eid="ROM 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6"/>Ingieseye bi Hudai kielienshi belienni wo giezhi ese kieliezho. <char style="png">Isilie</char>se olusanlashi man <char style="png">Isilie</char> kun pusho. <verse eid="ROM 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7"/><char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char>ni houdeilashi man hhei kewosi pusho. Zinie <char style="pn">Isaghei</char>se olusei chii houdei giezhi urune giezho. <verse eid="ROM 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8"/>Isishi beyese olusan kesilashi man Hudai kewosi pusho. Zinie dain giesan mutun olusan kesilai houdeide sanane. <verse eid="ROM 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9"/>Eneshi Huda dain giesan kielien wo, "Gonien eli kuse bi irene. <char style="pn">Sare</char> nie kewon olune." <verse eid="ROM 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10"/>Zinie ene pusho. Mai xienren <char style="pn">Isaghei</char>se <char style="pn">Libaijia</char> shongo laikudeye qingiezho. <verse eid="ROM 9:10"/><verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11-12"/>Shongoni ese oluzhi gounii, doghunnii ese khizhekude Huda <char style="pn">Libaijia</char>de, "Jianlai fugieni ganinughunyi chenliene." giezhi kieliewo. Ingiezhi Huda kunni sunghuse goya mujighalane giezho. Kun giekughala ese giezho, kunni uruzhi iresan Huda jiejin giezho. <verse eid="ROM 9:11-12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13"/>Jinwun jiere Huda kieliesan mutun, "<char style="pn">Yagebu</char>de bi orezho, <char style="pn">Isao</char>de ese orezho."<verse eid="ROM 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14"/>Ingiese matan matui kieliene? Huda gundan uwonu? Kenjin pusho. <verse eid="ROM 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15"/>Huda <char style="pn">Musa</char>de kieliewo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:15">"Bi kiende ubali xiise kiende ubali xiine.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:15">Kiende nenjien ogise kiende nenjien ogine."<verse eid="ROM 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16"/>Ingie uzhese eneshi kunni duran, xiacha giekui kouisan pusho. Ubali xiisan Hudade kouizho. <verse eid="ROM 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17"/>Jinwun jiere Huda <char style="pn">Falao</char>de kieliezho, "Bi chii tungo giezhi nenline xienjighazhi qienxiade nierene chonji kurughane giezhi chii undudaghawo." <verse eid="ROM 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18"/>Ingie uzhese Huda kiende ubali xiise kiende ubali xiine. Kienyi khiduzheghase kienyi khiduzheghane.<verse eid="ROM 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hudai Ubali Xiiku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19"/>Ingiese chi made kieliene, "Qinse Huda kunlade yangiezhi gui teine? Kien hhei isii fandui giene?" <verse eid="ROM 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20"/>Chishi kien wo? Zinie kun wo. Hudaghala jianjindunu? Gholusan dunxi matugie hhei gholughasande, "Chi mii yangiezhi intui giewo?" giezhi kieliene? <verse eid="ROM 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21"/>Ighachi shuwa dundase niegieda shuwai agidene niei guizhuntu, niei bixintu ighai gieku qienli uwonu? <verse eid="ROM 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22"/>Hudaye niekielien wo. Hhe hokukune, nenline mejieghaku duran woma, hokuzhi widaghane giesan kunlade hende rennai giewo. <verse eid="ROM 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23"/>Ingiedene Huda ubali xiisan kunlade hhei fama olon bikui mejieghazho. Enelashi famai ogine giezhi melie zhunbei giesan kunla wo, <verse eid="ROM 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24"/>yeshijiu Huda uruzhi iresan matan wo. Gon <char style="png">Yutai</char> kun pusho, niman kunlaye enbene. <verse eid="ROM 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25"/>Zhen Huda <char style="bk">Hexiyani Shu</char> jiere kieliesan mutun,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">"Mii bexin pushotu kunlai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">bi mii bexin giezhi urune.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">Uye oresanlade</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">bi oresan giezhi urune."<verse eid="ROM 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26"/>Pse kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:26">"Ta mii bexin pusho giesan yen hhe oronde</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:26">hhelai chanqiku Hudai kesila giezhi urune."<verse eid="ROM 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27"/>
    <char style="png">Isilie</char> kunlai kieliese <char style="pn">Isaiya</char> fugiede kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:27">"<char style="png">Isilie</char> kunla olonde haibienni shazi niekielien woma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:27">zinie feiliesanlai jiuine.<verse eid="ROM 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28"/>Ezhan zemin jiere panjikune</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:28">ghujighande man gie baraghane."<verse eid="ROM 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29"/>
    <char style="pn">Isaiya</char> melieshi kieliezhi daosan mutun,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">"Qienwon buduini Ezhan matande houdei ese feilieghazhoshi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:29">matan zaojiu <char style="png">Sodoma</char>, <char style="png">Emola</char> gholuwo."<verse eid="ROM 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isilie Kunla Gouxioxini Ese Jienliewo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30"/>Ingiese matan matui kieliene? Hudare goudakui onxian ese giesan niman kunla xianxin giekughala Hudare goudawo. <verse eid="ROM 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31"/>Guijinghala Hudare goudane giesan <char style="png">Isilie</char> kunla khareidene guijinni mujide dai dazho. <verse eid="ROM 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32"/>Eneshi yan yenyin wo? Eneshi hhela giekudene kouizho, xianxin giekude ese kouizho. Hhela banjighaku tashi jiere banjiwo. <verse eid="ROM 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33"/>Jinwun jiere jilasan mutun,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">"Bi <char style="png">Xiwun</char>de nie banjighaku tashi teiwo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">Kunni banjighaku tashi wo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">Hhei xianxin giesan kunla jiuren ulie giene."<verse eid="ROM 9:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1"/>Gaijiula, bi zhughedene panjizhi Hudase onxian giesanshi <char style="png">Isilie</char> kunlai jiuise giezho. <verse eid="ROM 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2"/>Hhela Hudade rexin bikui bi ganzhen beizhoma, zhao unhuaghala ese giezho. <verse eid="ROM 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3"/>Hudai gundanni ulie mejiene. Goya gundanine gholughane giezhi Hudai gundanni ulie shunjine. <verse eid="ROM 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4"/>Mexihashi guijinni uzhu wo. Jien xianxin giesan kunlai gounide sanane.<verse eid="ROM 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ezhanyi Xiahua Giechen Kunlai Man Jiuine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5"/>Guijinghala gounide sanakui ene shiqinyi giesan kunla amiturane giezhi <char style="pn">Musa</char> huaizhoma, <verse eid="ROM 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6"/>xianxin giekughala gounide sanaku daolii ingiezhi kieliezho, "Kien asiman jiere khireine giezhi chi zhughedene bu kielie." (Jiushi Mexihani jierese lai bouzheghane giezho.) <verse eid="ROM 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7"/>Pse "Kien dozoheide boune giezhi chi zhughedene bu kielie." (Jiushi Mexihani fugusan kun dundase lai khizheghane giezho.) <verse eid="ROM 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8"/>Hhe kieliesanshi ene wo, "Hudai kielien chase gholo uwo. Chii amande, zhughede wo." Jiushi bijien chonjisan xianxin gieku daoli wo. <verse eid="ROM 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9"/>Chi amandene <char style="pn">Ersa</char>shi Ezhan wo giezhi chenren giezhi zhughedene Huda hhei fugusan kun dundase aminne olughasei xianxin giese jiuine. <verse eid="ROM 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10"/>Kun zhughedene xianxin giese gounide sanane, amandene chenren giese jiuine. <verse eid="ROM 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11"/>Jinwun jiere kieliezho, "Jien hhei xianxin giesan kunla jiuren ulie giene." <verse eid="ROM 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12"/><char style="png">Yutai</char> kun, <char style="png">Xila</char> kun yama chabie uwo. Soyuji kunlade niekozi Ezhan wo, hhei xiahua giesan soyuji kunlade dafande ogine. <verse eid="ROM 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13"/>"Jien Ezhanni nierei xiahua giesan kunlai jiuine."<verse eid="ROM 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14"/>Qinse kun hhei xianxin ulie giese matugie xiahua giene? Hhei chenliezhi ese daodene matugie xianxin giene? Kieme ulie chonjise matugie chenliene? <verse eid="ROM 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15"/>Kiemei ese peise matugie chonjine? Jinwun jiere jilasan mutun, "Gouxioxii chonjisan kunlai koronlon zhengiejia seighan wo!" <verse eid="ROM 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16"/>Ingieliuzhe kunla man gouxioxini shunjisan pusho. <char style="pn">Isaiya</char> kieliezho, "Ezhan, bijien chonjisanyi kien xianxin giewo?" <verse eid="ROM 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17"/>Ingiese xianxin giekushi chenliesanse irezho. Chenliesanshi Mexihani kieliense irezho. <verse eid="ROM 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18"/>Bi nie asaye. Kunla ese chenliewu? Kenjin chenliezho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">"Hhelai shenqi qienxiade kuruwo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:18">Hhelai kielien duyani uzhude kuruwo."<verse eid="ROM 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19"/>Bi pse asaye. <char style="png">Isilie</char> kun yama ulie mejienu? Mejiene! Xien <char style="pn">Musa</char> Hudai kielienyi ingiezhi kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">"Bi minzude ulie sanaku minzuni tungo giezhi tai dubilieghane.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:19">Bi yama ulie mejiechen minzui tungo giezhi tai hokughane."<verse eid="ROM 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20"/>Pse <char style="pn">Isaiya</char> danzine fugiedaghazhi Hudai kielienyi ingiezhi kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">"Mii ese ereisan kunlade bi chujiegheghane.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:20">Mii xiahua ese giesan kunlade bi xienjighane."<verse eid="ROM 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21"/>
    <char style="png">Isilie</char> kunlade hhe kharei ingiezhi kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:21">"Bi niudunie kielien ulie chenliezhi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:21">jianjinduku bexinlai jienliene giezhi khane rouizho."<verse eid="ROM 10:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11"/>
  <para style="s">Isilie Kun Dunda Feilieghasan Kunla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1"/>Ingiese bi asaye, Huda goya bexinne bendawu? Kenjin uye! Bishiye <char style="png">Isilie</char> kun, <char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char>ni houdei, <char style="pn">Bienyamin</char> jiawuse khizhesan wo. <verse eid="ROM 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2"/>Huda melie mejiesan bexinlane ese bendazho. Jinwun jiere <char style="pn">Iliya</char>i matugie kieliesei ta ulie mejienu? Hhe Hudade <char style="png">Isilie</char> kunlai zhazhi kieliezho, <verse eid="ROM 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3"/>"Ezhan, hhela chii xienzhilai alazhi sidagha gieku chii teizii cheiwo. Jianie bi feiliezhi hhela dou mii aminyi kerene." <verse eid="ROM 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4"/>Ingiese Huda matugie huida giewo? Bi goyadene oluzhi <char style="pn">Bali</char>i ese beiisan 7000 kun feilieghawo giezho. <verse eid="ROM 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5"/>Edeku shihouye niekielien wo. Feiliesan kun wine. Hhelai nenjienghala sunghuzho. <verse eid="ROM 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6"/>Nenjienghala giese giekughala ese giezho. Qingiese nenjienshi nenjien pusho.<verse eid="ROM 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7"/>Ingiese matugie gholuwo? <char style="png">Isilie</char> kunla goya ereisanne ereizhi olu dawo. Zinie Huda sunghusan kunla ereizhi oluwo. Psedu kunlai zhughe khiduzhewo. <verse eid="ROM 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8"/>Jinwun jiere jilasan mutun,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">"Huda hhelade sudoku zhughe ogizho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:8">nudunlani chanla dane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:8">chighinlaiye sonosu dazhi eli kuwo."<verse eid="ROM 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9"/>Pse <char style="pn">Dawude</char> kieliewo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">"Hhelai ijieku xini sa, on,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:9">banjighaku, bouin gieku gholusejiu.<verse eid="ROM 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10"/>Hhelai nudun borolozhi chujieghe dasejiu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:10">Hhelai nurun ibeizi ghodeisejiu."<verse eid="ROM 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11"/>Ingiese bi asaye, hhela banjise bosizhe danu? Kenjin pusho! Hhela codadene jiuiku niman kunlade echise <char style="png">Isilie</char> kunlai dubilieghazho. <verse eid="ROM 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12"/><char style="png">Isilie</char> kunlai codasan duyai kunlade haochu ireghazho, hhelai ese olusan niman kunlade gounii ireghazho. Qinse <char style="png">Isilie</char> kunlai man jiuiku dunda oroghase ireku gounii genjia fugie uwonu?<verse eid="ROM 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13"/>Bi ta niman kunlade kielieye. Bishi niman kunlade peisan shitu wo. Ene wiliei bi fugiede uzhekushi <verse eid="ROM 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14"/>goya minzune dubilieghazhi ezighan jiuine giezho. <verse eid="ROM 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15"/>Huda hhelai bendadene duyai kunlare goudazho, hhelai jienliese zhengiejia gou uwonu? Fugusanse aminne olusan niekielien wo. <verse eid="ROM 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16"/>Hudade ogiku ghurun ganjinshi nieduizi ghurun man ganjin wo. Mutun genzi ganjinshi chalaye ganjin wo.<verse eid="ROM 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17"/>Bilase nie ganlan mutunyi giedun chalani ghigha bouzhedene yeganlan chalai chaiwo. Chishijiu chaisan chala wo. Chaisan chala mutun genzise gounii hhantu xiikude <verse eid="ROM 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18"/>ghighasan chalade kuai dane. Kuaine giese chi jila. Chi genzii ese qiezhezho, genzi chii qiezhezho. <verse eid="ROM 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19"/>Ingiese chi kieliene, 'Hhezighan chalai ghigha bouzhekushi mii chaine giezho.' <verse eid="ROM 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20"/>Oluzho! Hhela xianxin ulie giese ghigha bouzhezho, chi xianxin giese beizho. Ingiese ayizhi goyane undude bu uzhe. <verse eid="ROM 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21"/>Huda yenlaiku chalai sheise chiiye sheine. <verse eid="ROM 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22"/>Ingie uzhese Huda renyi, yenge wo. Hhezighan xinyan jiere banjisan kunlade yenge wo, tande renyi wo. Chi renyideni chanqi kouise beizhoma, pse chiiye ghigha widaghane. <verse eid="ROM 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23"/><char style="png">Isilie</char> kunla ulie guidene xianxin giese yen chaine. Hudade erchan chaiku nenli wine. <verse eid="ROM 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24"/>Chishi goya osisan ganlan mutun jierese ghighazhi bouzhedene zeilasan ganlan mutun jiere zhenchan wide chaisan wo. Qinse yenlaiku chalai yenlaiku mutun jiere chaise genjia zhenchan uwonu?<verse eid="ROM 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Soyuji Isilie Kunlai Man Jiuine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25"/>Gaijiula, bi ene mimii tande mejieghaku duran wo. Pse ta goyalane jienzha wo giene. Ene mimishi niman kunlai jiuiku shuzi kurutula niezhan <char style="png">Isilie</char> kunlai zhughei khiduzheghazho. <verse eid="ROM 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26"/>Ingiedene <char style="png">Isilie</char> kunlai man jiuine. Jinwun jiere jilasan mutun,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">"<char style="png">Xiwun</char>se jiuichen khizhezhi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:26">
    <char style="png">Yagebu</char>se xienlian wituni widaghane.<verse eid="ROM 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27"/>Hhe shihoude bi hhelai zuini widaghane.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:27">Eneshijiu bi hhelare yenjisan kielien wo."<verse eid="ROM 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28"/>Gouxioxighala kieliese <char style="png">Isilie</char> kunla Hudare duitou gholudene tande haochu ireghawo. Hhelai xienrenni sunghusei uzhese hhelashi Huda oresan wo. <verse eid="ROM 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29"/>Hudai nenjien, uruku ulie bienjine. <verse eid="ROM 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30"/>Ta eqighandei Hudai ulie shunjiku mutun ede hhelai ulie shunjiku yenyinghala tande kharei ubali xiizho. <verse eid="ROM 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31"/>Niekielien wo. Hhela ede uye shunjizhoma, tande ubali xiisan yenyinghala ede hheladeye ubali xiine. <verse eid="ROM 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32"/>Huda soyuji kunlai ulie shunjiku dunda oroghazhi khakushi soyuji kunlade ubali xiine giezho.<verse eid="ROM 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33"/>Hudai bayan, agheli, erlin matui fugie wo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:33">Hhe panjikui kiema mejie dane!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:33">Hhe giekui kiema dunjire dane!<verse eid="ROM 11:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34"/>"Kien Ezhanyi zhughei mejiene?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:34">Kien hhende sughachen danlane?"<verse eid="ROM 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35"/>"Kien Hudade xien ogidene khareizhi goyadene honjighane?"<verse eid="ROM 11:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36"/>Soyujila man hhense khizhezhi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:36">hhende kouizhi hhende oluzho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:36">Kuaikui chanqi hhende ogi! Amine!<verse eid="ROM 11:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12"/>
  <para style="s">Giekughala Libai Gie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1"/>Ingiese gaijiula, bi Hudai ubali xiikughala tai goude fenfulaye. Ta beyene amitu mure danlaghazhi Hudade ogi. Intu mureshi Huda xiqi biku wo, zhiguitu wo. Eneshijiu zhenzhenji beiiku wo. <verse eid="ROM 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2"/>Ene duyani bu dagha. Sumulakune arunzhazhi shinishighadene Hudai gou, bayasuku, onqien isii shiizhi mejie.<verse eid="ROM 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3"/>Bi made ogisan nenjienghala ta jien kunlade kielieye, goyane texien undude bu uzhe. Goude sumulazhi Huda tande ghughazhi ogisan xianxin gieku fenlianghala goyane heshide uzhe. <verse eid="ROM 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4"/>Matanyi nie beye jiere iyanzi olon biliuzhe zoin buxian mutun <verse eid="ROM 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5"/>matanye olon woma, Mexihai miende nie beye wo. Nienieji beyede lienjizhi buxiantu iyanzi gholuwo. <verse eid="ROM 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6"/>Huda nenjienghalane matande buxiantu nenli ogizho. Hudai kielienyi kieliekushi xianxin gieku kamaghala kielie. <verse eid="ROM 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7"/>Ushilakushi ushila, surughakushi surugha. <verse eid="ROM 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8"/>Zhichi giezhi kieliechenla zhichi gie. Ogichenla dafande ogi. Gonjichenla xiacha giezhi gonji. Ubali xiichenla bayasuzhi gie.<verse eid="ROM 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9"/>Orekude jianii bu deila. Doghunnii henji, gounii barei. <verse eid="ROM 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10"/>Zhenzhenji orekughala nieniedene ore. Ranjizhi nieniene zunji. <verse eid="ROM 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11"/>Langan bu giedene zhughesene rexinde Ezhanni shunji. <verse eid="ROM 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12"/>Panjizhi bayasu, kunnan dunda rennai gie, izhi onxian gie. <verse eid="ROM 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13"/>Nanxintu shentulade ogi. Bayasuzhi kunlai jienlie. <verse eid="ROM 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14"/>Tai heisanlade oluzhi gouni kielie, bu kharadene gouni kielie. <verse eid="ROM 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15"/>Bayasuchen kunlare hhantu bayasu, wilachen kunlare hhantu wila. <verse eid="ROM 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16"/>Nieniedene heqitughan, goyane undude bu uzhezhi bixin kunlare laiwon gie. Goyane jienzha wo bu gie. <verse eid="ROM 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17"/>Kiemade doghunnide doghunnii bouchou bu gie, dajiala gou wo giesan shiqinni jinlianji gie. <verse eid="ROM 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18"/>Tande nengou bise jinlianji jien kunlare heqitu. <verse eid="ROM 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19"/>Mii orentula, goyane bouchou bu giedene Ezhan hhelai faikui saghei. Jinwun jiere jilasan mutun, "Ezhan kieliezho, 'Bouchoushi bi giekui wo, bi kharulune.'" <verse eid="ROM 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20"/>Khareidene chii duitou oliesuse ijiegha. Undasuse ochigha. Chi ingiezhi giese shitan khanni hhei qiorun jiere teizho. <verse eid="ROM 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21"/>Goyasene doghunnii bu injigha, gounighala doghunnise inji.<verse eid="ROM 12:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13"/>
  <para style="s">Qienli Bareichenlai Shunji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1"/>Jien kunla qienli bareisan noyenlai shunji. Qienlishi man Hudase irezho. Soyuji qienli bareichenlashi Huda jinjisan wo. <verse eid="ROM 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2"/>Ingiese qienli bareichenlai fandui giese Huda jinjisanyi fandui giezho. Fandui giesanla goyadene faikui ereizho. <verse eid="ROM 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3"/>Noyenlashi gouni giesanlai ayighachen pusho, doghunni giesanlai ayighachen wo. Chi qienli bareichenlase ulie ayine giezhou? Gouni giema, hhela chii kuaine. <verse eid="ROM 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4"/>Hhelashi tai haochude olusan Hudai hoji wo. Chi doghunni giese indan ayikui wo. Hhela khudoghoi belien bareisan pusho. Hhelashi doghunni giesan kunlai faichen Hudai hoji wo. <verse eid="ROM 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5"/>Ingiese ta bixi shunji, zinie Hudai hokuruku yenyinghala pusho, lianxinni yenyinghala wo. <verse eid="ROM 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6"/>Ta shui ogikuyeshi ene yenyin wo. Hhelashi zhomen ene shiqinyi gonjisan Hudai hoji wo. <verse eid="ROM 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7"/>Jien kunlade indan ogikui ogi. Shui ghurasande shui ogi, baer ghurasande baer ogi. Indan zunjichenlai zunji, danren giekulai danren gie.<verse eid="ROM 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Oreku Guijinni Chenjighawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8"/>Nieniedene orekuse chugo kiemade zhan bu chai. Kunlade orechenla guijinni chenjighawo. <verse eid="ROM 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9"/>Piofen bu gie, kun bu ala, bu ghula, tanxin bu gie giesan minlin, psedu guijinla man goyadene mutun giebeidene ore giesan ene minlinde bouizho. <verse eid="ROM 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10"/>Orechen kun giebeidene doghunni ulie giene. Ingiese oreku guijinni chenjighawo.<verse eid="ROM 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11"/>Ingiekushi edeshi yan shihou bikui ta mejiene. Ta hhunturazhi xiereiku shihou wo. Matanyi jiuiku matan dei xianxin gieku shihouse ede chadashizho. <verse eid="ROM 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12"/>Xieni daozhi ogheine giezho. Ingiese matan kharanide giesan shiqinlai jiedene gieghantu baohu gieku majiani musiye. <verse eid="ROM 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13"/>Matan udude gieku mutun yan gieliuzhe donzhende gieye. Lon naduzhi sudoku, lon kijiezhi hu gieku, jianjinduzhi dubilieku enelai bu gieye. <verse eid="ROM 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14"/>Khareidene Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihai musi. Zui gieku durande jihui bu ogizhi nefuxinni bu dagha.<verse eid="ROM 13:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14"/>
  <para style="s">Kunlai Bu Kielie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1"/>Xianxin gieku zholientu kunlai ta jienlie. Ijien buxianshi bu jianjindu. <verse eid="ROM 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2"/>Niezhan kunla yanniliuzhe ijiese olune giezhi xianxin giezho. Xianxin gieku zholientu kunla zinie cai ijiene. <verse eid="ROM 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3"/>Migha ijiesan kunla migha ese ijiesan kunlai meilade bu uzhe, migha ese ijiesan kunla migha ijiesan kunlai bu kielie. Huda hhelai jienliewo. <verse eid="ROM 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4"/>Kunlai hojii kieliezhi chishi kien wo? Hhela olu, ulie olu ezhanyini shiqin wo. Ezhande olughaku nengou wine. Ingiese hhe olu shidane.<verse eid="ROM 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5"/>Niezhan kunla enenie udui psedu udulase zhunyo wo giezho. Niezhan kunla niuduniei uzhedan niekielien wo giezho. Alinie kunliuzhe zhughedene oluzhou ese olusei jiejin gie gie. <verse eid="ROM 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6"/>Udu jilasan kunla Ezhande oluzhi udu jilazho. Ijiesan kunla Hudade mafan giedene Ezhande oluzhi ijiezho. Ese ijiesan kunlaye Hudade mafan kieliedene Ezhande oluzhi ese ijiezho. <verse eid="ROM 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7"/>Matan alinie kunliuzhe goyadene oluzhi ese amiturazho. Goyadene oluzhiye ulie fugune. <verse eid="ROM 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8"/>Matan amitushi Ezhande oluzhi amiturazho. Fuguseye Ezhande oluzhi fugune. Ingiese matan amitura, fuguliuzhe Ezhannughun wo. <verse eid="ROM 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9"/>Mexiha fugusan kun, amitu kunde Ezhan danlane giezhi duya ijiedene aminne oluwo. <verse eid="ROM 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10"/>Matan man Hudai shenpantai melie beine. Chi yale gaijiune kieliene? Chi yale gaijiune meilade uzhene? <verse eid="ROM 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11"/>Jinwun jiere jilasan mutun,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">"Ezhan kieliewo, 'Bi goyane aminghala fayen gieye.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">Soyuji odoula made xiutuliene.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">Soyuji amanla bishi Huda wo giezhi chenren giene.'"<verse eid="ROM 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12"/>Ingiese matan alinie kunliuzhe Hudai melie goyane shiqinyi jiodai giene.<verse eid="ROM 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gaijiulane Zui Bu Fanjigha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13"/>Ingiese matan nieniene bu kielieye. Jiexin xiaizhi gaijiulai melie boujia, banjighaku dunxii bu tei. <verse eid="ROM 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14"/>Bi Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i xianxin giezhi kenjin mejiene. Yandeliuzhe benshen ganjin wituni uwo. Zinie kun ganjin uwo giese hhende ganjin uwo. <verse eid="ROM 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15"/>Chi ijiunighala gaijiulane munan gieghase oreku daolighala ese giezho. Mexiha hhende oluzhi duya ijiewo, chi goyane ijiunighala hhei baxi bu olugha. <verse eid="ROM 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16"/>Ingiese ta goya gounine kunlai bu sugiegha. <verse eid="ROM 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17"/>Hudai gojiashi ijieku, ochiku pusho, Shenlin ogisan gundan, heqi, bayasuku wo. <verse eid="ROM 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18"/>Mexihani ingiezhi shunjisan kunde Huda bayasune, kunlaye kuaine. <verse eid="ROM 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19"/>Ingiese matan heqituzhi nieniene hendaghakui xiacha gieye. <verse eid="ROM 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20"/>Ijiunighala Hudai wiliei bu qida olugha. Manshi ganjinni woma, chi ijiedene kunlai zui fanjighase ese oluzho. <verse eid="ROM 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21"/>Migha ijie, jiu ochi, pse yan shiqindeliuzhe gaijiulani zui fanjighakui ulie giese gou wo. <verse eid="ROM 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22"/>Chi xianxin giesanne Hudai melie goude barei. Kun goyane gou wo giesan shiqinyi giedene gui ulie teise fuqi wine. <verse eid="ROM 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23"/>Inxin giezhi ijiese zui jinjine. Xianxin giekughala ese ijiezho. Xianxin giekughala giesanni pushoshi man zui wo.<verse eid="ROM 14:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15"/>
  <para style="s">Kunlai Bayasugha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1"/>Matan khidun kunla indan goyane bu bayasughazhi khidun witu kunlai zholiennii danjikuni wo. <verse eid="ROM 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2"/>Matan alinie kunliuzhe kunlai haochude oluzhi bayasughazhi hhelai hendaghakuni wo. <verse eid="ROM 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3"/>Mexihaye goyane ese bayasughazho. Jinwun jiere jilasan mutun, "Chii sugiesan kunlai sugieku man mii jiere irewo." <verse eid="ROM 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4"/>Eqighandei huaisan jinwunshi man matande oluzhi sughazhi huaisan wo. Hhe matai rennai gieghazhi sughazhi kieliedene matande xiwon ogizho. <verse eid="ROM 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5"/>Bi onxian giese rennai gieghazhi sughazhi kieliesan Huda tai sumuladanyi Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i daghazhi nie gholughadene <verse eid="ROM 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6"/>dajiala man hhantu mai Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihani Ada Hudai kuai!<verse eid="ROM 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Soyuji Minzula Hudade Doulane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7"/>Ingiese Mexiha tai jienlieku mutun taye nieniene jienliezhi Hudai kuai. <verse eid="ROM 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8"/>Bi kieliese Mexiha Hudai zhendaode oluzhi <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunlade hoji danlazhi xienrenlade dain giesei chenjighawo, <verse eid="ROM 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9"/>pse niman kunlai Huda hhelade ubali xiisande kuaighazho. Jinwun jiere jilasan mutun,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">"Ingiese bi niman kunlai dunda chii chenren giene.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:9">Bi donghala chii nierei doulane."<verse eid="ROM 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10"/>Pse kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:10">"Niman kunla, ta Ezhanyi bexinlare hhantu bayasundu."<verse eid="ROM 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11"/>Pse,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">"Soyuji niman kunla, ta Ezhande doulandu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:11">Soyuji minzula, hhende doulandu!"<verse eid="ROM 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12"/>Pse <char style="pn">Isaiya</char> kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">"Jianlai <char style="pn">Yexi</char>ni houdei irene.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">Hhe khizhedene niman kunlai gonjine.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">Niman kunla hhei xiwon giene."<verse eid="ROM 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13"/>Xiwon ogisan Huda ta xianxin giekude yanyanji bayasukui, pinnanni tai zhughede durughazhi Shenlinni nenlighala xiwon olon ogi gie!<verse eid="ROM 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Niman Kunlade Chonjiku Baoloni Wilie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14"/>Mii gaijiula, tande gouni, yanyanji agheli duruzhi ta nieniedene surugha shidakui bi kenjin mejiene. <verse eid="ROM 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15"/>Ingieliuzhe bi niezhan shiqin jiere tai sumula ireghane giezhi danzine fugiedaghazhi tande xin huaikushi Huda made ogisan nenjienghala <verse eid="ROM 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16"/>bi niman kunlade oluzhi Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>de wiliechi danlazho. Bi hhelade Hudai gouxioxii chonjise buwa niekielien wo. Shenlinyi tungo giezhi hhelai zhiguishighadene jienlieku mure mutun Hudade ogizho. <verse eid="ROM 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17"/>Ingiese Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i miende bi Hudade oluzhi giesan shiqinde kuaikui wine. <verse eid="ROM 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18"/>Niman kunlai shunjighane giezhi Mexiha mii tungo giezhi giesan wiliese chugo bi psedulai yama ulie kieliene. Hheshi kielienji, giekughala giesan wo. <verse eid="ROM 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19"/>Ghudureqi, fugie shiqinyi nenlighala, pse Hudai Ruhheryi nenlighala giesan wo. Bi Mexihai gouxioxii <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>se izhi <char style="png">Ililigu</char>de man chonji kurughawo. <verse eid="ROM 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20"/>Ingiezhi bi Mexihani nierei chenliezhi ese daosan oronlade chonjine giezhi hende duralakushi kunlai jigun jiere gie ulie beighane giezho. <verse eid="ROM 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21"/>Jinwun jiere jilasan mutun,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">"Hhei xioxii mejie dasanla chanlane.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:21">Chenliezhi ese daosanla dunjirene."<verse eid="ROM 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baolo Lomade Echiku Jihua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22"/>Ene yenyin jiere bi tai hhende haojihui echine giezhoma, echi dazho. <verse eid="ROM 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23"/>Ede ene oronlade chonjiku oron widazho, pse haojinien bi tai hhende echiku duralazho. <verse eid="ROM 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24"/>Ingiese bi <char style="png">Xibenya</char>de echikude tai ochira, xien nietan laiwon giezhi xianshou giedene ta mii khughose giezhi xiwon giezho. <verse eid="ROM 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25"/>Ingiezhoma, ede bi <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de echizhi shentulade banman giene giezho. <verse eid="ROM 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26"/><char style="png">Maqidun</char>, <char style="png">Yagaiya</char>ni kunla <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>ni nanxintu shentulade banman giene giezhi bayasuzhi baer khireighawo. <verse eid="ROM 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27"/>Hhela enei bayasuzhi giekushi shuhuajia shentulade chaizho. Niman kunla hhelase ruhher jieredu haochui ghughazhi echise hhela injikude banman giese indanji wo. <verse eid="ROM 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28"/>Ingiese bi kunla khireighasanni goude jiuizhi ogi ene shiqinyi onchen giedene tai hhense jingo giezhi <char style="png">Xibenya</char>de echine. <verse eid="ROM 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29"/>Bi tai hhende irekude Mexihani olon nenjienni deilazhi irekui bi mejiene.<verse eid="ROM 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30"/>Gaijiula, bi matanyi Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexiha, Shenlinni orekughala tande goude fenfulaye. Ta mare hhantu xiacha giezhi made oluzhi Hudase ingiezhi onxian gie, <verse eid="ROM 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31"/>"Mii <char style="png">Yudaya</char> oronni xianxin ulie giechen kunlai khade bu oroghazhi bi <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de banman giesan shiqinde shentulai bayasuzhi jienliegha gie. <verse eid="ROM 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32"/>Pse mii Hudai isighala tai hhende bayasuzhi iregha tanre hhantu hhamuragha gie." <verse eid="ROM 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33"/>Pinnan ogisan Huda ta dajialare hhantu bi gie. Amine!<verse eid="ROM 15:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16"/>
  <para style="s">Kielien Asazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1"/>Bi <char style="png">Jiengeli</char>ni jiohuide gonjia danlasan mai eghechijiu <char style="pn">Feibi</char>ni tande jieshao gieye. <verse eid="ROM 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2"/>Ta Ezhanni miende hhei shentula indan gieku mutun heshide jienlie. Hhe yan shiqinde banman kerese banman gie. Hhe olon kunlade banman giezho, madeye banman giezho.<verse eid="ROM 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3"/>
    <char style="pn">Baijila</char>, <char style="pn">Yajila</char>de kielien asa. Hhela Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i miende mare hhantu wilie giezho. <verse eid="ROM 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4"/>Mii aminde oluzhi goya aminne ese kerewo. Zinie bi hhelade mafan kielieku pusho, niman kunlai jiohuila man hhelade mafan kieliezho. <verse eid="ROM 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5"/>Pse hhelai gieni jiohuii kunlade kielien asa. Bi oresan <char style="pn">Ibainitu</char>de kielien asa. Hheshi <char style="png">Yaxiya</char> oronyi ji 1 gie Mexihai xianxin giesan kun wo. <verse eid="ROM 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6"/><char style="pn">Mereiyen</char>de kielien asa. Hhe tande oluzhi hende khishulazho. <verse eid="ROM 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7"/>Mare hhantu bafanzi sousan mii qingu <char style="pn">Andonigu</char>, <char style="pn">Yuniya</char>de kielien asa. Hhela shitulai dunda minshen fugie wo, mase melie Mexihai xianxin giezho. <verse eid="ROM 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8"/>Ezhanyi miende bi oresan <char style="pn">Anboli</char>de kielien asa. <verse eid="ROM 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9"/>Mexihai miende matanre hhantu wilie giesan <char style="pn">Erbanu</char>, pse bi oresan <char style="pn">Shidagu</char>de kielien asa. <verse eid="ROM 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10"/>Mexihai miende olune giesan <char style="pn">Yabili</char>de kielien asa. <char style="pn">Yalidobu</char>i giei kunlade kielien asa. <verse eid="ROM 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11"/>Mii qingu <char style="pn">Xiloqien</char>de kielien asa. <char style="pn">Naqishu</char> giei Ezhanyi miendedu kunlade kielien asa. <verse eid="ROM 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12"/>Ezhanyi miende khishulasan <char style="pn">Tufeina</char> <char style="pn">Tufusa</char> ghualade kielien asa. Ezhanyi miende hende khishulasan oresan <char style="pn">Bixi</char>de kielien asa. <verse eid="ROM 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13"/>Ezhanyi miende sunghusan <char style="pn">Lufu</char>, hhei anadeni kielien asa. Hhei ana made ana danlazho. <verse eid="ROM 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14"/><char style="pn">Yaxinqitu</char>, <char style="pn">Fulegan</char>, <char style="pn">Xiermi</char>, <char style="pn">Baloba</char>, <char style="pn">Heima</char>, pse hhelare hhantuku gaijiulade kielien asa. <verse eid="ROM 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15"/><char style="pn">Feilologu</char>, <char style="pn">Yuliya</char>ghala, <char style="pn">Niliya</char>, hhei eghechijiughala, <char style="pn">Alinba</char>, pse hhelare hhantuku shentulade man kielien asa. <verse eid="ROM 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16"/>Ta zhughesene nieniedene kielien asa. Mexihani jiohuila man tande kielien asazho.<verse eid="ROM 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zuihoude Sughaku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17"/>Gaijiula, bi tai xiahua gieye, ta surusan daolini fandui giezhi tai khudoghozhi banjighachen hhezighan kunlase gholodo. <verse eid="ROM 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18"/>Imutu kunla mai Ezhan Mexihai ulie shunjizhi zinie goya shiqinne guizhi kuaiku seighan kielienghala loushi kunlai miine. <verse eid="ROM 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19"/>Tai shunjisan shiqinla gochude chonji kuruzho. Ingiese bi tande oluzhi bayasuzho. Mii duranshi ta gou shiqin jiere jienzhaghan, doghun shiqin jiere menghan. <verse eid="ROM 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20"/>Pinnan ogisan Huda Ibilisii kon douratai taizhi ireghaku ghujinlazho. Matanyi Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihani nenjien tanre hhantu bi gie!<verse eid="ROM 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21"/>Mare hhantu wilie giesan <char style="pn">Qimotai</char>, mii qingu <char style="pn">Luqiu</char>, <char style="pn">Yaso</char>, <char style="pn">Soxibade</char> enela tande kielien asazho. <verse eid="ROM 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22"/>Made xin deilazhi huaisan <char style="pn">Deqi</char> Ezhanyi miende tande kielien asazho. <verse eid="ROM 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23"/>Mii jienliezhi jiohuini kunlai man jienliesan <char style="pn">Gaiyu</char> tande kielien asazho. Chenshii baer gonjisan <char style="pn">Iladu</char>, mai gaijiu <char style="pn">Kotu</char>ghala tande kielien asazho.<verse eid="ROM 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Doulaku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25"/>Hudade kuaikui ogi. Bi chonjisan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihai gouxioxighala, eqighanku gonyinni niuighasan mimii mejieghakughala Huda tai khiduzhegha shidane. <verse eid="ROM 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26"/>Ene mimi ede xienjizhi khizhezho. Chanqiku Hudai minlin mutun xienzhilai shuni tungo giezhi soyuji minzulade mejieghadene hhelai xianxin gieghazhi shunjighawo. <verse eid="ROM 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27"/><char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihai tungo giezhi zi niekozi aghelitu Hudade chanqi kuaikui ogi. Amine!<verse eid="ROM 16:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16"/>
</usx>
